      "name": "Soak",
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "Whisk the condensed milk, evaporated milk, and cream together. Prick the warm cake all over with a fork and pour the milks over slowly, letting each addition sink in.",
          "tip": "It looks like far too much liquid. It is not — the sponge takes all of it overnight."
        },
        {
          "text": "Cover and refrigerate overnight.",
          "duration_minutes": 720
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Finish",
